Package: com.rileytestut.altdaemon
Name: AltDaemon Modern (RootHide)
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Depends: ellekit (>= 1.2)
Description: AltDaemon for RootHide jailbreaks with current Apple login compatibility.
 AltDaemon allows compatible AltStore builds to install and refresh apps
 without a computer. This build targets RootHide jailbreaks and contains
 arm64 and arm64e slices.
Maintainer: AltDaemonModern contributors
Author: Riley Testut and AltDaemonModern contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/altstoreio/AltStore
Section: Tweaks
